                                                    "children": [],
                                                    "className": "android.widget.TextView",
                                                    "text": "Flint can't stop the date or time being changed. During the same phone boot, Flint times started sessions and scheduled blocks, breaks, Emergency Pass recovery and the wait for the next pass by elapsed time, and clock changes don't reset spent opens or pending waits. Saved schedules keep their time zone and stay on Flint's saved timeline. Daily time limits use the phone's day, so a clock change can move when they reset, and website checks for scheduled rules follow the phone's clock. After a phone restart, some access can end, and pass renewal or a daily reset can take longer, because Flint can't always tell how much time really passed.",
